<title>New Zealand: Shell NZ joints Mobil, BP in petrol price rise.</title>
<headline>Shell NZ joints Mobil, BP in petrol price rise.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell New Zealand on Thursday joined Mobil Oil and BP in raising petrol prices.</p>
<p>Shell said in a statement it would increase wholesale prices of both grades of petrol by one cent per litre.</p>
<p>It blamed the increase on rising crude oil prices and increased costs of imported product.</p>
<p>Mobil and BP announced similar increases on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
